  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "MovieGuys",
      "content": "\"A Bona Fide Killer\" is the perfect mix. A wife and mother who just happens to be a deadly assassin, using her sniping skills to rid society of criminals that evade real justice. Great depth and chemistry between the main characters, combined with well-paced backstories and action, results in a top-notch series that is wholly engaging and enjoyable. Thankfully too, it doesn't take itself too seriously either, which adds to its charm.\r\n\r\nIn summary, great casting, an excellent script and lots of well-paced action add up to an excellent series that's worth your time.",
